extends ../layout/layout
block content
    section#post.postBlue.postSearch
        h1 #{app_name_shorcut} How  
          span to
    section#posts.default-area
        article
            h1 How to use it
            ol.main-content
                li
                    | Select the ontologies from which you want to extract patterns.
                    ol(type="a")
                        li
                            | Patterns Info
                            ul
                                li Type: the patterns are going to be created from the type of the terms.
                                li Name: the patterns are going to be created from the name of the terms.
                                li Both: created from both.
                        li
                            | Flatten Info
                            ul
                                li Yes: the collections are going to be flattened.
                                li No: the collections are not going to be flattened.
                li
                    | Select patterns options:
                    ol(type="a")
                        li
                            | Name, Type or both:
                            ul
                                li
                                    | Name: Ontology elements in the patterns represent specific classes and properties names. For example:
                                    h3.title-example 
                                        | Fragmento de codigo owl en serializacion turtle
                                    p.example-description
                                                | Example with Name and Not flatten selected
                                        div.code
                                            pre
                                                code.
                                                    |s4bldg:BuildingSpace
                                                    |rdfs:subClassOf
                                                    | |owl:Restriction
                                                    | | |owl:allValuesFrom
                                                    | | | |owl:Class
                                                    | | | | |owl:unionOf
                                                    | | | | | |rdf:List
                                                    | | | | | | |rdf:first
                                                    | | | | | | | |s4bldg:Building
                                                    | | | | | | |rdf:rest
                                                    | | | | | | | |rdf:List
                                                    | | | | | | | | |rdf:first
                                                    | | | | | | | | | |s4bldg:BuildingSpace
                                                    | | | | | | | | |rdf:rest
                                                    | | | | | | | | | |rdf:nil
                                                    | | |owl:onProperty
                                                    | | | |s4bldg:isSpaceOf
                                li
                                    | Type: Ontology elements in the patterns are generalized according to the OWL elements used, that is, no specific classes or properties are used, but OWL skeletons like:
                                    div.code
                                        pre
                                            code.
                                                | owl:Class
                                                |   |rdfs:subClassOf
                                                |   |  |owl:Restriction
                                                |   |  |  |owl:onProperty
                                                |   |  |  |  |owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty
                                                |   |  |owl:someValuesFrom
                                                |   |  |  |rdfs:Datatype
                        li
                            | Flatten or not:
                            ol
                                li
                                    | Flatten: If there are collections of classes or individuals in the pattern it is not included the full collection.
                                   
                                    h3.title-example 
                                        | Fragmento de codigo owl en serializacion turtle
                                    p.example-description
                                                | Example with Type and Not flatten selected                                 
                                        div.code
                                            pre
                                                code.
                                                    | owl:Class
                                                    |rdfs:subClassOf
                                                    | |owl:Restriction
                                                    | | |owl:allValuesFrom
                                                    | | | |owl:Class
                                                    | | | | |owl:unionOf
                                                    | | | | | |rdf:List
                                                    | | | | | | |rdf:first
                                                    | | | | | | | |owl:Class
                                                    | | | | | | |rdf:rest
                                                    | | | | | | | |rdf:List
                                                    | | | | | | | | |rdf:first
                                                    | | | | | | | | | |owl:Class
                                                    | | | | | | | | |rdf:rest
                                                    | | | | | | | | | |rdf:nil
                                                    | | |owl:onProperty
                                                    | | | |owl:ObjectProperty, owl:TransitiveProperty
                                    br.
                                    p.example-description
                                                | Example with Type and flatten selected                                      
                                    div.code
                                        pre
                                            code.
                                                |owl:Class
                                                |rdfs:subClassOf
                                                | |owl:Restriction
                                                | | |owl:allValuesFrom
                                                | | | |owl:Class
                                                | | | | |owl:unionOf
                                                | | |owl:onProperty
                                                | | | |owl:ObjectProperty, owl:TransitiveProperty
            h2 Output
            p Tengo que ver el output final y definir esto en detalle
