                li “Data” folder. This folder contains the files:
                    ul
                        li A
                        li B
                        li C
                li “flatten” folder (if selected): This folder contains the files:
                    ul
                        li A
                        li B
                        li C
                li “not_flatten” folder (if selected): This folder contains the files:
                    ul
                        li A
                        li B
                        li C
                li HTML folder This folder contains the files:
                    ul
                        li A
                        li B
                        li C
